  << /ActualText (I\031m Ane\054 a Basque product designer based in Brooklyn\056\n\nI design creative tools and digital products that turn complex ideas into experiences people can easily understand\054 learn\054 and enjoy\056 I\031m especially drawn to products that help people build confidence\054 express themselves\054 and create without unnecessary friction\056\n\nToday I lead product design for creative software\054 shaping products such as\240)
